export anchor GridTemplateRows:
    description:
        Defines the rows of the grid: how many there are and how tall each one is. Lines between them may be named in square brackets.

    identifier: gridTemplateRows

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `grid-template-rows` property.

    values:
        - `none`
        - `<track-size> ...`
        - `repeat(<count>, <track-size>)`
        - `repeat(auto-fill, <track-size>)`
        - `repeat(auto-fit, <track-size>)`
        - `[<line-name>] <track-size> ...`

    initial: none

    appliesTo: Grid containers.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            gridTemplateRows: 64px 1fr auto
        \\\
        ```
